00:11:31.446 --> 00:11:33.156
Yes, this is the Central Rescue Team’s emergency rescue team.

256
00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:34.783
[Kang Hyuk] This is Baek Kang Hyuk from Hankuk University Hospital.

257
00:11:35.826 --> 00:11:36.660
Ah…

258
00:11:36.743 --> 00:11:38.620
Now on Bukhansan Mountain
There is someone asking for help

259
00:11:38.704 --> 00:11:40.080
You mean they can't send a helicopter?

260
00:11:40.163 --> 00:11:41.373
[Rescue worker] Professor, that is

261
00:11:41.456 --> 00:11:43.083
- I thought about the situation...
- Come here right now.

262
00:11:43.166 --> 00:11:44.918
I think I'll have to go

263
00:11:48.046 --> 00:11:48.880
Wait a minute

264
00:11:48.964 --> 00:11:49.798
Just a moment...

265
00:11:50.882 --> 00:11:52.092
Ah, one second is a waste right now.

266
00:11:52.175 --> 00:11:53.677
- What are you doing!
- [Man] Hello?

267
00:11:54.469 --> 00:11:55.303
Professor Baek Kang-hyuk?

268
00:11:55.846 --> 00:11:57.305
Yes, who are you?

269
00:11:57.389 --> 00:12:00.016
- I am the new team leader.
- [Dark Music]

270
00:12:00.559 --> 00:12:01.893
I already heard about it

271
00:12:01.977 --> 00:12:03.937
Professor Baek, looking at the records so far,

272
00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:06.815
Just a phone call
You used the helicopter as your own.

273
00:12:06.898 --> 00:12:08.608
You can't just do what's convenient.

274
00:12:08.692 --> 00:12:09.568
- This is the country’s property.
- Yes?

275
00:12:10.152 --> 00:12:11.945
- What, convenient? membrane?
- Why, why?

276
00:12:12.028 --> 00:12:14.197
[Deokgyu] Record of driving yourself
There you are

277
00:12:14.948 --> 00:12:16.742
Do you have a helicopter pilot license?

278
00:12:16.825 --> 00:12:18.452
[Kang Hyuk] Something like that now
Is it time to argue?

279
00:12:18.535 --> 00:12:21.371
I don't even have a license
Would you have taken the wheel?

280
00:12:21.455 --> 00:12:23.039
Send a helicopter right now!

281
00:12:23.123 --> 00:12:24.416
[Deokgyu] Don’t speak informally.

282
00:12:24.916 --> 00:12:27.419
From now on, this will be done on a wired basis.
Business cooperation is not possible

283
00:12:28.044 --> 00:12:31.715
By writing an official document
Get approval from the manager and proceed with the procedure.

284
00:12:31.798 --> 00:12:33.467
- [Call end sound]
- What do you mean...

285
00:12:33.967 --> 00:12:35.594
Honey, hey, hey!

286
00:12:35.677 --> 00:12:36.970
- [재원] 교수님, 교수님
- 이런

287
00:12:37.053 --> 00:12:39.806
- 개새끼!
- [Loudly] Hey, hey, professor!

288
00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:41.516
No swearing, no swearing

289
00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.351
- [Kanghyuk’s angry breathing]
- Calm down.

290
00:12:44.436 --> 00:12:46.354
Breathe, breathe

291
00:12:46.938 --> 00:12:47.939
[Kang Hyuk] Oh! Mr.

292
00:12:49.441 --> 00:12:50.942
Why are you like this, why are you like that, why are you like that, why are you like that?

293
00:12:51.026 --> 00:12:52.736
Are you really saying they won’t send a helicopter?

294
00:12:52.819 --> 00:12:55.530
Yes, no matter what the professor says
It's not even a guess

295
00:12:56.114 --> 00:12:56.948
Okay, that's it.

296
00:12:57.783 --> 00:12:59.618
- [Rose Sigh]
- First of all, since Bukhansan Mountain is urgent...

297
00:13:00.118 --> 00:13:01.787
Contact the on-site rescue team.

298
00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:03.163
[cell phone vibrating sound]

299
00:13:03.246 --> 00:13:04.247
[Rescuer] Hello?

300
00:13:04.331 --> 00:13:05.832
[Jaewon] Yes, Korea University Hospital
This is Jaewon Yang.

301
00:13:05.916 --> 00:13:07.375
Well, how is the patient’s condition now?

302
00:13:08.084 --> 00:13:09.878
[Rescue worker] My blood pressure is 50 out of 80.

303
00:13:09.961 --> 00:13:12.798
Without consciousness
Left eye loses pupillary reflex

304
00:13:12.881 --> 00:13:13.715
Have you left?

305
00:13:13.799 --> 00:13:16.092
[Jaewon] Oh, that’s it…

306
00:13:16.176 --> 00:13:19.221
We are heading out right now.
It might be a bit difficult, that…

307
00:13:19.304 --> 00:13:21.723
To launch a helicopter from Jung-gudan
They said I had to send an official letter.

308
00:13:21.807 --> 00:13:22.849
[Rescuer] An official document?

309
00:13:23.683 --> 00:13:25.560
It's payment time
It would only be possible in the morning.

310
00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.064
Even though it's an emergency, it doesn't work?

311
00:13:29.147 --> 00:13:30.690
[Jaewon] I tried talking, talking, talking.

312
00:13:32.692 --> 00:13:34.277
Well, then maybe, then…

313
00:13:34.361 --> 00:13:36.363
Is it accessible by car?

314
00:13:36.446 --> 00:13:37.823
[Rescuer] Ah, yes, it is possible.

315
00:13:37.906 --> 00:13:40.158
Somehow to the entrance of the hiking trail
I will move the patient

316
00:13:40.242 --> 00:13:41.493
Please come as soon as possible

317
00:13:41.576 --> 00:13:42.619
Ah, yes, I understand.

318
00:13:44.996 --> 00:13:45.914
Hey, hey!

319
00:13:46.414 --> 00:13:47.958
you do what you want
What if I go there?

320
00:13:48.041 --> 00:13:49.042
What, are you going to take a taxi?

321
00:13:49.125 --> 00:13:51.503
If that's the case, well, at all
Tell them to put the patient there and send him there.

322
00:13:52.003 --> 00:13:54.005
You know, there's an ambulance, an emergency room, an ambulance.

323
00:13:54.965 --> 00:13:56.216
- [Dark music stops]
- Ambulance?

324
00:13:56.299 --> 00:13:57.259
[Jaewon] Yes

325
00:13:57.342 --> 00:13:59.135
[Interesting music]

326
00:14:03.098 --> 00:14:05.058
[Kanghyuk] I really don’t have time
What are you doing?

327
00:14:05.141 --> 00:14:06.184
- [Rose] So,
- [Kanghyuk] Huh?

328
00:14:06.685 --> 00:14:07.519
What is this?

329
00:14:07.602 --> 00:14:09.437
[Rose] In the meantime, we were dispatched by helicopter
I had nothing to write about

330
00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:13.233
With trauma center support
I bought a luxury ambulance.

331
00:14:13.316 --> 00:14:15.110
For the sake of showing off to those above you

332
00:14:15.193 --> 00:14:16.903
Hey, this has everything.

333
00:14:16.987 --> 00:14:18.488
this good car
Why haven't you used it in a while?

334
00:14:18.572 --> 00:14:19.698
Hey, leave now

335
00:14:19.781 --> 00:14:21.783
[Jaewon] Yes, I understand.
I'll ride behind you, Professor.

336
00:14:24.828 --> 00:14:25.829
Gangster, aren’t you riding?

337
00:14:25.912 --> 00:14:27.789
I need to be in the hospital

338
00:14:27.873 --> 00:14:29.875
[Kanghyuk] No
Without you, we won't be able to fit in.

339
00:14:30.375 --> 00:14:32.377
-What kind of people...
- Oh, get in quick, get in quick.

340
00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:33.795
- [Rose] Ah…
- [Buckle clicking sound]

341
00:14:34.754 --> 00:14:36.339
- [Interesting music stops]
- [Car starting sound]

342
00:14:36.423 --> 00:14:38.425
- [Upbeat music]
- [Siren sound]

343
00:14:49.769 --> 00:14:51.021
[Rose's sharp scream]

344
00:14:52.856 --> 00:14:54.107
- [tire rubbing sound]
- [Embarrassed sound]

345
00:14:54.649 --> 00:14:55.859
- [tire rubbing sound]
- [Moan of the Rose]

346
00:14:55.942 --> 00:14:56.985
[Engine acceleration sound]

347
00:15:01.531 --> 00:15:02.407
Ouch!

348
00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:05.201
Professor, please drive carefully!

349
00:15:05.285 --> 00:15:06.202
[panting] Ai

350
00:15:06.286 --> 00:15:07.787
Ah, why did you bring me here?

351
00:15:07.871 --> 00:15:08.997
- You brought me here to kill you...
- [Engine acceleration sound]

352
00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:10.916
- [tire rubbing sound]
- [Scream of the Rose]

353
00:15:20.091 --> 00:15:20.926
[Rough breathing]

354
00:15:21.009 --> 00:15:22.969
look ahead, look ahead

355
00:15:23.053 --> 00:15:24.304
[car horn]

356
00:15:27.933 --> 00:15:29.601
[Rough breathing]

357
00:15:35.065 --> 00:15:35.982
[Kang Hyuk] Hey, number 1!

358
00:15:36.066 --> 00:15:37.734
Because everyone has come
Ask for exact location

359
00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:41.071
[Jaewon] We’re almost there
Where are you?

360
00:15:43.406 --> 00:15:44.240
professor!

361
00:15:44.324 --> 00:15:45.825
It's on the right at the crossroads.

362
00:15:48.244 --> 00:15:49.996
[tire rubbing sound]

363
00:15:51.039 --> 00:15:51.915
[tire rubbing sound]

364
00:15:59.714 --> 00:16:00.757
[Romance of the Rose]

365
00:16:01.341 --> 00:16:02.175
[The rose continues to moan]

366
00:16:08.181 --> 00:16:09.224
[Gear operation sound]

367
00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.727
- [The cheerful music fades away]
- [Jaewon’s nausea sound]

368
00:16:13.478 --> 00:16:15.730
[Kanghyuk] Hey, it’s been a while.
This doesn't look like the old form.

369
00:16:15.814 --> 00:16:16.898
This is so fast...

370
00:16:16.982 --> 00:16:19.651
Speed? Completely ‘no break’
It was a runaway locomotive.

371
00:16:19.734 --> 00:16:21.736
- Oh, it's noisy. Oh, the patient is coming!
- [Jaewon’s struggling sounds]

372
00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:22.988
Teacher Jaewon, hurry!
Quickly, quickly, quickly

373
00:16:23.071 --> 00:16:24.990
[Sound of difficulty]

374
00:16:33.081 --> 00:16:34.666
[Kanghyuk] Because I don’t have time
Let's talk as we go.

375
00:16:34.749 --> 00:16:35.583
[Rescuer 1] Yes

376
00:16:36.543 --> 00:16:37.961
[Heavy music]

377
00:16:38.044 --> 00:16:39.004
[Elasticity of roses]

378
00:16:39.087 --> 00:16:39.921
[Elasticity that gives strength]

379
00:16:43.008 --> 00:16:44.384
[Rescuer 2]
We'll take your car away.

380
00:16:47.721 --> 00:16:49.222
[loud siren sound]

381
00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:55.311
Ah, your Gangnam valet part-time job skills are still the same.

382
00:17:01.026 --> 00:17:02.652
[Kang Hyuk] On the left
You said there was no pupil reflex, right?

383
00:17:02.736 --> 00:17:03.945
When was the last time you checked?

384
00:17:04.029 --> 00:17:06.114
[Rescuer] Just at the time of discovery.
It was not implemented after that.

385
00:17:06.197 --> 00:17:07.032
[Jaewon] Professor

386
00:17:07.115 --> 00:17:08.950
Fortunately, there is no urination or defecation.

387
00:17:09.617 --> 00:17:10.910
[Kang Hyuk] Okay, let’s begin
Push your head first

388
00:17:10.994 --> 00:17:12.746
- [Jaewon] Yes, I understand.
- [clattering sound]

389
00:17:15.457 --> 00:17:16.291
[clattering sound]

390
00:17:20.920 --> 00:17:22.839
There is no right side, we have to hurry.

391
00:17:22.922 --> 00:17:24.382
Is it very bad?

392
00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.636
[Kang Hyuk] If there was direct damage to the brain
There is no way

393
00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:30.472
due to cerebral hemorrhage
If it happened temporarily

394
00:17:30.555 --> 00:17:31.514
There is hope

395
00:17:33.391 --> 00:17:35.477
[Sighing] A little more
I should have come sooner

396
00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:36.895
Quickly push it and disinfect it.

397
00:17:37.395 --> 00:17:38.813
I need to make an incision right now.

398
00:17:38.897 --> 00:17:40.398
[Rescue worker] Oh, hey, wait a minute.

399
00:17:40.482 --> 00:17:41.316
Incision?

400
00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.151
- In a moving car?
- [Kanghyuk] Yes

401
00:17:43.902 --> 00:17:45.195
I need to break through right now.

402
00:17:54.204 --> 00:17:55.663
[Woman] Teacher Jangmi, are you coming?

403
00:17:56.164 --> 00:17:59.209
Please submit a request for neurosurgery collaboration.
You can see it right away when you arrive

404
00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:03.755
[Kanghyuk’s sigh]

405
00:18:03.838 --> 00:18:05.715
There's no room in my skull

406
00:18:07.634 --> 00:18:09.094
My brain pressure is very high.

407
00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:12.305
[Kang Hyuk] It’s not good, I can’t even see the bleeding.

408
00:18:13.556 --> 00:18:15.183
[Rescuer] Is it really that bad?

409
00:18:16.893 --> 00:18:19.104
If bleeding is the cause
Just remove it.

410
00:18:20.021 --> 00:18:22.065
The brain like this
When it's swollen overall...

411
00:18:22.649 --> 00:18:23.650
Give them steroids

412
00:18:24.609 --> 00:18:25.693
Let's drill another hole

413
00:18:26.361 --> 00:18:28.446
[Rescuer] Huh? More holes?

414
00:18:31.282 --> 00:18:32.450
What are you doing, not preparing?

415
00:18:38.373 --> 00:18:40.083
[Hesitating] Does it have any meaning?

416
00:18:42.418 --> 00:18:43.253
[Beeping warning sound]

417
00:18:43.336 --> 00:18:44.379
[Rescue worker] Blood pressure drops

418
00:18:48.883 --> 00:18:49.884
[Engine acceleration sound]

419
00:18:55.098 --> 00:18:56.057
heart rate is okay

420
00:18:56.141 --> 00:18:57.100
No. 1, disinfect quickly

421
00:18:57.851 --> 00:18:59.602
Brainstem herniation is in progress.

422
00:19:00.145 --> 00:19:01.646
[Kang Hyuk] Still
You should try what you can

423
00:19:02.772 --> 00:19:03.815
[rustling sound]

424
00:19:03.898 --> 00:19:05.650
- Get the patient quickly
- [Continuous rummaging sound]

425
00:19:05.733 --> 00:19:06.985
[Sound of rustling vinyl]

426
00:19:07.068 --> 00:19:07.902
No. 1!

427
00:19:09.487 --> 00:19:11.114
Let's live and die alone, what can we do if we try hard?

428
00:19:11.197 --> 00:19:12.532
Everyone else is giving up

429
00:19:12.615 --> 00:19:13.700
So

430
00:19:13.783 --> 00:19:14.826
What, should we give up too?

431
00:19:14.909 --> 00:19:15.743
[Frustrated sigh]

432
00:19:16.452 --> 00:19:19.747
The hospital is at a loss, what is it?
I just crave it every day

433
00:19:19.831 --> 00:19:20.915
[clattering sound]

434
00:19:20.999 --> 00:19:23.418
If you don't send me an official letter
They say they won’t fly the helicopter and they hold out.

435
00:19:24.043 --> 00:19:25.336
What is this all about, Professor!

436
00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:27.630
until when
They're probably just blaming the helicopter.

437
00:19:27.714 --> 00:19:28.715
Now it's our turn

438
00:19:28.798 --> 00:19:30.258
Yes, you said that well!

439
00:19:30.341 --> 00:19:32.051
Even if only that helicopter had been launched

440
00:19:32.135 --> 00:19:34.345
This patient also had a chance!

441
00:19:34.429 --> 00:19:35.555
Won't you shut up?

442
00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:39.601
Even at this moment when you are talking
This patient is dying, you know?

443
00:19:41.978 --> 00:19:43.146
Shut up and get the patient

444
00:19:44.314 --> 00:19:45.398
I'm going to drill another one

445
00:20:01.247 --> 00:20:02.916
- [Sound of bed falling down]
- [Rose] Professor!

446
00:20:02.999 --> 00:20:05.877
A request was made for neurosurgery collaboration.
You are waiting now

447
00:20:08.588 --> 00:20:10.423
[The sound of wheels rumbling becomes distant]

448
00:20:10.506 --> 00:20:12.258
[The heavy music fades]

449
00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:15.178
[Junyong] This is neurosurgeon Noh Junyong.

450
00:20:15.261 --> 00:20:16.429
[Kang Hyuk] Manager
You came out in person.

451
00:20:16.512 --> 00:20:18.556
When I get a chance
Always willing to help

452
00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:20.391
[Kang Hyuk] Yes, you said that.
thank you

453
00:20:20.475 --> 00:20:22.393
- [Junyong] Prepare the CT right away.
- [Doctor] Yes, chief.

454
00:20:30.318 --> 00:20:31.444
Hey there

455
00:20:31.527 --> 00:20:32.403
- Maybe
- [Rescuer] Yes.

456
00:20:32.987 --> 00:20:34.447
What happened when you arrived?

457
00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:37.575
I thought I heard some fighting.

458
00:20:40.203 --> 00:20:42.413
[Application] Overall
The functionality is greatly lacking.

459
00:20:43.998 --> 00:20:45.959
At least my senses are okay.

460
00:20:47.543 --> 00:20:48.878
[Kang Hyuk] The problem is with the motor.

461
00:20:49.545 --> 00:20:50.380
[Junyong] Yes

462
00:20:51.756 --> 00:20:54.092
Maybe even if I wake up
You will need help for the rest of your life.

463
00:20:55.301 --> 00:20:57.428
Fortunately, Professor Baek
Thank you for taking good action

464
00:20:58.096 --> 00:20:59.639
Although my life was saved for now,

465
00:20:59.722 --> 00:21:01.140
[heavy music]

466
00:21:01.224 --> 00:21:02.517
Well, first of all, it’s the acute stage.

467
00:21:03.601 --> 00:21:05.478
After additional inspection
Let's wait and see.

468
00:21:06.437 --> 00:21:07.772
No need to request collaboration

469
00:21:08.273 --> 00:21:10.149
We take care of it
We will follow up

470
00:21:11.484 --> 00:21:12.860
Please take care of me

471
00:21:16.155 --> 00:21:17.156
[Sound of door opening]

472
00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.074
[Rose] Ah, that professor

473
00:21:19.617 --> 00:21:21.119
The guardian has arrived.

474
00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.833
[sigh]

475
00:21:30.753 --> 00:21:31.587
[Kang Hyuk] The patient

476
00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:35.341
[Hesitating] You are in a vegetative state.

477
00:21:35.425 --> 00:21:37.135
[Guardian's cry]

478
00:21:37.969 --> 00:21:39.595
[Crying] How can I not?

479
00:21:41.055 --> 00:21:41.889
[Kang Hyuk] I’m sorry

480
00:21:43.641 --> 00:21:46.144
[Guardian crying] What should I do?

481
00:21:48.855 --> 00:21:50.565
[Guardian continues to cry]

482
00:21:51.566 --> 00:21:52.942
[Kanghyuk’s long breathing sound]

483
00:21:55.111 --> 00:21:57.405
[Junyong] If you went by helicopter
Do you think it was okay?

484
00:21:58.489 --> 00:22:00.199
Professor Baek looks heartbroken.

485
00:22:02.243 --> 00:22:04.203
Tracheotomy in a moving car

486
00:22:04.287 --> 00:22:06.581
Even a hole in the head
I pierced two holes.

487
00:22:09.125 --> 00:22:10.877
I did everything to save it.

488
00:22:12.086 --> 00:22:14.297
I'm going to try to save that patient.
I said I struggled

489
00:22:25.099 --> 00:22:26.601
Didn't the helicopter take off?

490
00:22:31.230 --> 00:22:33.566
[deep sigh]

491
00:22:34.984 --> 00:22:37.070
It stinks, huh?

492
00:22:37.153 --> 00:22:39.197
Apparently, my brother was in the fire chief's hospital room.

493
00:22:39.280 --> 00:22:40.865
Haha, I said it was a good thing.

494
00:22:41.574 --> 00:22:43.785
It’s 100%, this, huh?

495
00:22:43.868 --> 00:22:44.952
Please tell me?

496
00:22:45.495 --> 00:22:46.996
- Roll it up?
- [Heavy music fades out]

497
00:22:47.663 --> 00:22:48.790
[sigh]

498
00:22:48.873 --> 00:22:51.042
Oh, I'm with Baek Kang-hyuk.
We shouldn't become friends

499
00:22:53.669 --> 00:22:54.670
Oh, how pretty is this, Mr.

500
